Hi,

I'm running acpi on Compaq EVO N1000v - it seems to have the same acpi
implementation then EVO 800v.
I have tryed to use kernel with fixed DSDT table for EVO 800. Finally I was
able to see my battery status and so on ... , but I couldn't get
thermal_zone status. (It worked for me with my old dsdt).
I'm sending my /proc/acpi/dsdt (raw) and dmesg output.

 <<dmesg.log>>  <<dsdt.raw>>

--------------------------
Tomas Cibulka
IS Operations
Orange Slovensko a.s.


